OL,3,GNEWSAI made it my mission to get back
OL,4,Aunderground after being trapped in a
OL,5,Acave for 54 hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man trapped for 54 hours in the UK's
OL,8,Flongest cave rescue said it was his
OL,9,Fmission to "get back underground" as
OL,10,Fsoon as possible.
OL,12,FGeorge Linnane from Bristol was
OL,13,Fexploring deep in the Ogof Ffynnon Ddu
OL,14,Fcave system in the Brecon Beacons with
OL,15,Ffriends when he fell, breaking a leg,
OL,16,Fhis jaw and three ribs.
OL,18,F"I always wanted to get back
OL,19,Funderground. I kind of made it my
OL,20,Fmission. I decided this very early on
OL,21,Fwhilst I was still in the hospital,"
OL,22,Fsaid the 43-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,434,430,260,140,0,100
