OL,3,GNEWSAI made it my mission to get back
OL,4,Aunderground after being trapped in a
OL,5,Acave for 54 hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter nine months of recovery and
OL,8,Fslowly building up his physical
OL,9,Ffitness, Linnane was able to return to
OL,10,Fhis adventurous hobby, even revisiting
OL,11,Fthe cave where he fell in November
OL,12,F2021.
